sdpa-bwd-xe-hpg: oneDNN's pull request #6472 (Barzin, open on 2026-11-09; its second commit), on v3.14.2, applied
by CMakeLists.txt after 0001.  Its change as the pull request has it; only the context of the configurations' table
is v3.14.2's (main has other xe2 rows there).

The SDPA's fused backward on xe_hpg (Alchemist, the Arc A series), which v3.14.2 refuses ("fused SDPA BWD not
supported for xe_hpg"), with the configurations its pull request swept on an Arc A770.  XeStrata's training step
times it against the engine's own backward forms and takes the fastest.
